# Perennial phase 2 on Arc MAINNET (chain 5042): the public inputs of DeployPerennial,
# Handoff and VerifyRoles. Addresses only, never a key. The deployer key stays in
# contracts/.env (PRIVATE_KEY) on the owner's Mac. Runbook:
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-28-perennial-mainnet-deploy.md
#
# Oracle + ledger: the common-markets stack (Registry/Attestation 2026-09-27, NanoLedger).
# PROTOCOL_TREASURY: the RegiFeeSplitter (40% of what it receives buys back and burns REGI).
# APPROVED_AGENT = OPERATOR: the mainnet keeper operator (milestone feeds, releases, binding).
# Phase-1 contracts: pinned in DeployPerennial (MAINNET_*).
